    "show_share": true,
    "description": "AKU-ISMC's Professor Gianluca Parolin has recently published a paper on  Enquêteurs (non) familiers: Qui mène les enquêtes dans les séries télévisées égyptiennes/ (Un)familiar Investigators: Who Is Leading the Investigations in Egyptian Television Series?  for the book entitled   Le récit criminel arabe/Arabic Crime Fiction .",
